        'A prioritised content and local-page plan, with clear reasons for adding, combining or improving each page.',
        'Google Business Profile ownership and information checks where the business is eligible; changes require authorised access.',
        'A review of relevant care directories, factual inconsistencies and the destinations of profile links.',
        'Approved edits to titles, headings, service copy, navigation and contextual internal links.',
        'Relevant link opportunities through real partnerships, sector resources or editorial contributions; no purchased ranking schemes or invented affiliations.',
